  id: psu
  displayName: Power Supply (PSU)
  category: 5
  icon: {fileID: 0}
  mlLabel: psu
  mlAliases: []
  specChips:
  - ATX
  - 700 W
  - 80+ Gold
  shortDescription: Turns wall power into the steady DC voltages every component
    needs.
  whatItDoes: The PSU converts AC mains electricity into 12 V, 5 V and 3.3 V DC and
    distributes it through its cables.
  keyFacts:
  - Rated at 700 W
  - Has 24-pin, EPS 8-pin, PCIe and SATA cables
  - Keep the switch at O (off) while building
  installationSteps:
  - Set the switch to O and unplug it.
  - Slide it into the bottom bay, fan facing down.
  - Screw it in from the back of the case.
  - Route cables through the grommets.
  safetyTip: "Never open a power supply \u2014 capacitors inside can hold a dangerous
    charge."
